# Coding

- Prefer simple and maintainable code.
- Reuse existing components.
- Avoid unnecessary abstraction.
- Do not add dependencies unless necessary.
- Follow `PROJECT.md` and `UI_GUIDELINES.md`.
- Do not generate application code during pure planning/documentation tasks.
- No bloated shared food DB patterns; keep personal-library and offline-first behavior intact.
